      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "🚨 Lifesaving Rescue 🚨\nOn May 1, an H125 crew responded to a 911 call near Mount Washington with a BORSTAR Paramedic. The patient—a diabetic stranded without insulin, food, or water for three days—was in dire need. When the H125 crew was unable to land due to the steep terrain, a Black Hawk crew arrived within minutes. Working together, the two aircraft coordinated to insert an AMO EMT and BORSTAR Paramedic via hoist. Using an Air Rescue Vest, the team safely extracted the patient and transferred him to a local hospital for urgent care. Exceptional teamwork and rapid response saved a life against the odds! #Rescue #BORSTAR #AMO #MountWashington",
      "text_resolved": "🚨 Lifesaving Rescue 🚨\nOn May 1, an H125 crew responded to a 911 call near Mount Washington with a BORSTAR Paramedic. The patient—a diabetic stranded without insulin, food, or water for three days—was in dire need. When the H125 crew was unable to land due to the steep terrain, a Black Hawk crew arrived within minutes. Working together, the two aircraft coordinated to insert an AMO EMT and BORSTAR Paramedic via hoist. Using an Air Rescue Vest, the team safely extracted the patient and transferred him to a local hospital for urgent care. Exceptional teamwork and rapid response saved a life against the odds! #Rescue #BORSTAR #AMO #MountWashington",
