      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Today marks the start of Police Week—a time to honor and remember the dedication and sacrifice of law enforcement officers across the nation. Yesterday, we ran the National Police Week 5K to pay tribute to our fallen officers, recognizing their courage and commitment to keeping our communities safe. The 5K is more than just a race; it’s a meaningful reminder of the lives lost in the line of duty and the enduring legacy they leave behind. Thank you to all who participated and continue to support our law enforcement community. #PoliceWeek #HonorTheFallen #NeverForgotten",
